      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n                Fikret Karakaya will be giving a masterclass on 24 and 25 May, from 10 am to 3 pm. It will take place at the Centre des Musiciens du Monde. The aim will be to work on musicality, phrasing, intonation, understanding makams and so on.\nHere’s how the masterclasses will work:\nYou bring your instrument and two or three pieces from the Ottoman/Turkish repertoire, with the scores. You will play them in front of Mr Karakaya, and he will advise you on ways of interpreting, on lʼintonation, phrasing, etc.\nPlaces are limited, and I would ask you to book your place as soon as possible, before it is full, as well as paying the money for this masterclass. To do this, write to royerartusonicolas@gmail.com.\nPrice of the masterclass: $200 for the two days\nYou can also attend the masterclass as a listener for $50 for both days.\n            "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
