        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Sava is a female vocal ensemble performing polyphonic a cappella music from the Balkans. With Sarah Albu, Antonia Branković, Dina Cindrić and Sara Rousseau."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Klapa (or klapsko pjevanje) is a multi-part singing tradition from the southern Croatian regions of Dalmatia. Sung in several voices,"
