      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "You will listen to a combination of traditional Maritime tunes with Rwandan melodies, accompanied by Baroque melodies on the lute and gheychak."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Come listen to traditional Rwandan songs and well-known Maritime artists at the String Constellation concert. Inspired by 17th century musical traditions,"
      }
