      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Murmorosi ensemble draws its inspiration from the Ukrainian tradition of polyphonic singing. Their repertoire includes both traditional songs performed a capella and a variety of original compositions and updated rearrangements of Ukrainian folklore. Murmurosi is a Montreal-based ensemble made up of Natalia Telentso and Eli Camilo, accompanied on occasion by guest musicians and singers, […]"
