    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<div class='xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/1f3b5.png' alt='🎵' width='16' height='16' /></span> Ender Balkır Live in Montreal <span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/1f3b5.png' alt='🎵' width='16' height='16' /></span></div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Join us for an unforgettable evening of music and culture with the renowned folk artist Ender Balkır! Known for his mesmerizing voice and masterful interpretations of Anatolian folk songs.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Co-produced by the Centre for Musicians of the World and Soro-production, this event will occur at the Saint-Enfant-Jésus du Mile End Church from 7:30 PM to 10:30 PM. A refreshment bar will be available, and there will be an intermission.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1/16/1f4c5.png' alt='📅' width='16' height='16' /></span> Date: Sunday, January 19, 2025<br class='html-br' /><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t34/1/16/23f0.png' alt='⏰' width='16' height='16' /></span> Time: 8:00 PM – 10:00 PM (Doors open at 7:15 PM)<br class='html-br' /><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png' alt='📍' width='16' height='16' /></span> Location: Saint-Enfant-Jesus church in Mile End, 5039 Saint-Dominique street, Montreal, QC H2T 1V1</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Prepare for an evening filled with soulful melodies that transcend borders, celebrating the rich heritage of folk music. Don’t miss this unique opportunity to experience a live performance by one of the most celebrated voices.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td8/1/16/1f39f.png' alt='🎟️' width='16' height='16' /></span> Reserve your spot now and be part of an enchanting musical journey.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>________________________________________</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/1f3b5.png' alt='🎵' width='16' height='16' /></span> Ender Balkır Montreal’da! <span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/1f3b5.png' alt='🎵' width='16' height='16' /></span></div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Ünlü halk müziği sanatçısı Ender Balkır ile müzik ve kültür dolu unutulmaz bir akşama davetlisiniz! Anadolu’nun zengin halk ezgilerini büyüleyici sesiyle yorumlayan Ender Balkır.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1/16/1f4c5.png' alt='📅' width='16' height='16' /></span> Tarih: Pazar, 19 Ocak 2025<br class='html-br' /><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t34/1/16/23f0.png' alt='⏰' width='16' height='16' /></span> Saat: 20:00 &#8211; 22:00 (Kapılar 19:15&#8217;te açılır)<br class='html-br' /><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png' alt='📍' width='16' height='16' /></span> Yer: Saint-Enfant-Jesus church in Mile End, 5039 Saint-Dominique street, Montreal, QC H2T 1V1</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>halk müziğinin zengin mirasını kutlayan ve sınırları aşan ezgilerle dolu bir geceye hazır olun.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td8/1/16/1f39f.png' alt='🎟️' width='16' height='16' /></span> Hemen yerinizi ayırtın ve büyüleyici bir müzik yolculuğuna katılın.</div> "
      }
