    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ender Balkir"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n                 Ender Balkır Live in Montreal \nJoin us for an unforgettable evening of music and culture with the renowned folk artist Ender Balkır! Known for his mesmerizing voice and masterful interpretations of Anatolian folk songs.\nCo-produced by the Centre for Musicians of the World and Soro-production, this event will occur at the Saint-Enfant-Jésus du Mile End Church from 7:30 PM to 10:30 PM. A refreshment bar will be available, and there will be an intermission.\n Date: Sunday, January 19, 2025 Time: 8:00 PM – 10:00 PM (Doors open at 7:15 PM) Location: Saint-Enfant-Jesus church in Mile End, 5039 Saint-Dominique street, Montreal, QC H2T 1V1\nPrepare for an evening filled with soulful melodies that transcend borders, celebrating the rich heritage of folk music. Don’t miss this unique opportunity to experience a live performance by one of the most celebrated voices.\n Reserve your spot now and be part of an enchanting musical journey.\n________________________________________\n Ender Balkır Montreal’da! \nÜnlü halk müziği sanatçısı Ender Balkır ile müzik ve kültür dolu unutulmaz bir akşama davetlisiniz! Anadolu’nun zengin halk ezgilerini büyüleyici sesiyle yorumlayan Ender Balkır.\n Tarih: Pazar, 19 Ocak 2025 Saat: 20:00 – 22:00 (Kapılar 19:15’te açılır) Yer: Saint-Enfant-Jesus church in Mile End, 5039 Saint-Dominique street, Montreal, QC H2T 1V1\nhalk müziğinin zengin mirasını kutlayan ve sınırları aşan ezgilerle dolu bir geceye hazır olun.\n Hemen yerinizi ayırtın ve büyüleyici bir müzik yolculuğuna katılın.\n            "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
  },
