        "@value": "<div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/1f3b5.png' alt='🎵' width='16' height='16' /></span> Ender Balkır Montreal’da! <span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/1f3b5.png' alt='🎵' width='16' height='16' /></span></div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Ünlü halk müziği sanatçısı Ender Balkır ile müzik ve kültür dolu unutulmaz bir akşama davetlisiniz! Anadolu’nun zengin halk ezgilerini büyüleyici sesiyle yorumlayan Ender Balkır.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1/16/1f4c5.png' alt='📅' width='16' height='16' /></span> Tarih: Pazar, 19 Ocak 2025<br class='html-br' /><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t34/1/16/23f0.png' alt='⏰' width='16' height='16' /></span> Saat: 20:00 &#8211; 22:00 (Kapılar 19:15&rsquo;te açılır)<br class='html-br' /><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png' alt='📍' width='16' height='16' /></span> Yer: Saint-Enfant-Jesus church in Mile End, 5039 Saint-Dominique street, Montreal, QC H2T 1V1</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>halk müziğinin zengin mirasını kutlayan ve sınırları aşan ezgilerle dolu bir geceye hazır olun.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td8/1/16/1f39f.png' alt='🎟️' width='16' height='16' /></span> Hemen yerinizi ayırtın ve büyüleyici bir müzik yolculuğuna katılın.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>________________________________________</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/1f3b5.png' alt='🎵' width='16' height='16' /></span> Ender Balkır en spactacle à Montréal <span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/1f3b5.png' alt='🎵' width='16' height='16' /></span></div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Rejoignez-nous pour une soirée inoubliable de musique et de culture avec le célèbre artiste folklorique Ender Balkır ! Connu pour sa voix envoûtante et ses interprétations magistrales de chansons folkloriques anatoliennes.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Coproduit par le Centre des musiciens du monde et Soro-production, cet événement aura lieu à l&rsquo;église Saint-Enfant-Jésus du Mile End de 19h30 à 22h30. Une buvette sera disponible et il y aura un entracte.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1/16/1f4c5.png' alt='📅' width='16' height='16' /></span> Date : dimanche 19 janvier, 2025<br class='html-br' /><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t34/1/16/23f0.png' alt='⏰' width='16' height='16' /></span> Horaire : 20h – 22h (ouverture des portes à 19h15)<br class='html-br' /><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t2d/1/16/1f4cd.png' alt='📍' width='16' height='16' /></span> Lieu : Église Saint-Enfant-Jesus du Mile End, rue 5039 Saint-Dominique, Montréal, QC H2T 1V1</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'>Préparez-vous à une soirée remplie de mélodies pleines d&rsquo;âme qui transcendent les frontières et célèbrent le riche héritage de la musique folklorique. Ne manquez pas cette occasion unique d&rsquo;assister à une prestation en direct de l&rsquo;une des voix les plus célèbres.</div> <div class='x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s'><span class='html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od'><img class='xz74otr' src='https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td8/1/16/1f39f.png' alt='🎟️' width='16' height='16' /></span> Réservez votre place dès maintenant et participez à un voyage musical enchanteur.</div> "
      }
