        "@value": "\n                Students concert – 7 June at 2 p.m.\n📍 Location: Parc Lahaie: 4921, boulevard Saint-Laurent\nMontréal (Québec)\n(If the weather does not permit, the concert will take place at the Centre des musiciens du monde, 5043 rue Saint-Dominique, just across the street)\nProgramme:\nComing soon\nCome one, come all to enjoy this wonderful musical afternoon! 🌞🎵\n            "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/eventStatus": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/EventScheduled"
      }
    ]
