        "@value": "Didem Başar – Sous la lune de Topkapı"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "<p><span class='TextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' lang='FR-CA' xml:lang='FR-CA' data-contrast='none'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-parastyle='Normal (Web)'>En pinçant les multiples cordes de son </span><strong><span class='NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-parastyle='Normal (Web)'>kanun</span></strong><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-parastyle='Normal (Web)'>, la grande cithare de Turquie, </span><strong><span class='NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-parastyle='Normal (Web)'>Didem</span> <span class='NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-parastyle='Normal (Web)'>Başar</span></strong><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-parastyle='Normal (Web)'> ouvre les portes d’un monde sonore aux éclats de cristal. Héritière d’une tradition séculaire, elle fait chanter ses 78 cordes avec une finesse et une émotion qui transcendent le temps.</span></span><span class='LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW17684542 BCX0'><span class='SCXW17684542 BCX0'> </span><br class='SCXW17684542 BCX0' /></span><span class='TextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' lang='FR-CA' xml:lang='FR-CA' data-contrast='none'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-parastyle='Normal (Web)'>Son répertoire, puisé dans les sources de la musique turque, déploie des mélodies aux inflexions subtiles, où chaque note semble porter le parfum d’Istanbul et la mémoire de ses rives,</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-charstyle='apple-converted-space' data-ccp-charstyle-defn='{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;2fd183b4-ad5c-5199-9fc7-89a6d0356079|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;1&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Aptos&quot;,469777842,&quot;&quot;,469777843,&quot;Aptos&quot;,469777844,&quot;Aptos&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Aptos&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,469775450,&quot;apple-converted-space&quot;,201340122,&quot;1&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;apple-converted-space&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,469778324,&quot;Default Paragraph Font&quot;]}'> </span></span><span class='TextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' lang='FR-CA' xml:lang='FR-CA' data-contrast='none'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-charstyle='Strong'>comme un reflet de lune sur les eaux du Bosphore</span></span><span class='TextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' lang='FR-CA' xml:lang='FR-CA' data-contrast='none'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-parastyle='Normal (Web)'>.</span></span><span class='LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW17684542 BCX0'><span class='SCXW17684542 BCX0'> </span></span></p> <p><span class='LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW17684542 BCX0'><br class='SCXW17684542 BCX0' /></span><span class='TextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' lang='FR-CA' xml:lang='FR-CA' data-contrast='none'><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-parastyle='Normal (Web)'>Entre virtuosité et délicatesse, ses interprétations tissent un lien vivant entre passé et présent, invitant l’</span><span class='NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-parastyle='Normal (Web)'>auditoire</span><span class='NormalTextRun SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-parastyle='Normal (Web)'> à un voyage où les résonances anciennes dialoguent avec la sensibilité d’aujourd’hui.</span></span><span class='EOP SCXW17684542 BCX0' data-ccp-props='{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6}'> </span></p> <p><strong>Artiste :</strong><br /> Didem Başar : kanun</p> "
      }
