        "@value": "\n                Every last Friday of the month, come share, listen, or simply discover a repertoire of traditional songs from here and elsewhere starting at 7:30 pm with a veillée!\nRegulars, newcomers, and accompanying musicians are all welcome!\nThe veillée is hosted by Lysandre Chartrand.\nFridays, April 24, and May 29, 2026, from 7:30 pm to 10:30 pm\nCost: $10 (cash only)\n            "
