    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n                Join Lamia Yared for three immersive evenings dedicated to the maqams of Arabic music, explored through the refined repertoire of muwashahat.\nDuring this intensive workshop in classical Arabic singing, you will discover their characteristic intervals and rhythms, while learning the essential basics of Oriental singing technique and interpretation.\nAn ideal format for refining your ear, voice, and musicality!\nFebruary 19 and 20 from 6 to 8 pm and February 21 from 3 to 5 pm\n \n            "
