    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Cajón workshop - Funk pop"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>A versatile instrument par excellence, the <strong>cajón</strong> can provide a solid rhythmic foundation in a multitude of contexts: it adapts easily to almost any musical style.</p> <p>This winter, join us for a series of intensive <strong>cajón workshops</strong> specially designed to teach you <strong>how to accompany different musical styles on the cajón</strong>.<br /> In three 1.5-hour sessions, you will be able to recognize, understand, and play the essential rhythms of <strong>funk-pop</strong>.</p> <p>We will work with audio tracks to help you clearly perceive how your cajón playing fits into the musical ensemble.</p> <p>Wednesdays, March 18, 25 and April 1st</p> "
      }
    ],
