        "@value": "Cajón workshop - Funk pop"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n                A versatile instrument par excellence, the cajón can provide a solid rhythmic foundation in a multitude of contexts: it adapts easily to almost any musical style.\nThis winter, join us for a series of intensive cajón workshops specially designed to teach you how to accompany different musical styles on the cajón.\nIn three 1.5-hour sessions, you will be able to recognize, understand, and play the essential rhythms of funk-pop.\nWe will work with audio tracks to help you clearly perceive how your cajón playing fits into the musical ensemble.\nWednesdays, March 18, 25 and April 1st\n            "
      }
    ],
